Using limits
\[
\lim_{h\to0} \frac{f(x_1+ h) - f(x_1)}{h}
\]
Back to \(x^2\)
\[
\lim_{h\to0} \frac{f(x+ h)^2 - x^2}{h} = \lim_{h\to0} \frac{x^2 + 2xh + 2h^2 - x^2}{h} = \lim_{h \to 0} \frac{2xh + 2h^2}{h}
\] \[
= \lim_{h \to 0} \frac{(2x+2h) h}{h}
\]

